hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"235","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum jannat mein dakhil na hoge jab tak iman na lao, aur iman na laoge jab tak aapas mein muhabbat na karo. Kya tumhein woh cheez na bataun jis se aapas mein muhabbat karo: aapas mein salam phailao. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
"236","[AI-translation] Teen cheezein jo inhein jama kare us ne iman jama kiya: apne nafs se insaf, sab ko salam, aur tangi mein kharch. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pucha: Kaunsa Islam behtar hai? Farmaya: Khana khilana, aur jaan-pehchan ho ya na ho salam karna. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
